notes = "ElementalMud in frozen dnd/monsters/spell_summon_actions.py is an actual internal AreaCondition but inherits has_visible_presence=false; AreaCondition.get_spatial_observation therefore publishes no visible owner/cells for this field. The corresponding Ground Resource already declares the same internal/no-artwork decision. This definition adds no body, footprint or invented observed owner; actual movement and affected-recipient results retain their own presentation. All artwork remains unreviewed."
